        "\n",
        "## 24.23 Common mistakes\n",
        "\n",
        "1. **Confusing a graph cycle with a topological loop.**  A triangle in a graph is a cycle, but in a Rips complex it is usually filled, so it does not contribute to $\\beta_1$.\n",
