        "\n",
        "5. **Forgetting sample-size effects.**  Persistent homology depends on how densely the underlying shape is sampled.\n",
        "\n",
        "6. **Treating persistent homology as a black box.**  Students should understand vertices, edges, triangles, boundary maps, and Betti numbers before using a library.\n",
